{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>The beard</b> Three times in the Masorah: הראש or הזקן. הזקן — the beard of Aaron. \"And also the beard\" — in the downfall of Sennacherib, teaches they were stricken with tzara'at. And because Aaron sees the negaim and purifies them with a log of oil, he merited the good oil of the anointing oil that descends upon his beard:"], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:19.269985283Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}